<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The activation screen and the language picker.

  Every key here exists in all 39 locale directories; check-invariants.sh fails
  the build if one does not. "subscription" belongs to the provider -- Castivio's
  seven days are a trial and always carry Castivio's name.

  The overline labels are stored in the case they are displayed in. Nothing calls
  uppercase() on them: that is locale-sensitive, strips accents in Greek and
  produces the wrong I in Turkish.
-->
